The WRT3200ACM is part of the [[toh:linksys:wrt_ac_series]], with 4 detachable antennas, and a faster dual core processor. It is a dualband, 802.11ac wave 2 (160MHz, no 80+80) capable device.\\
While only 1 revision of the hardware is listed, silently (around Nov 2017) the flash chip was updated in production causing earlier firmwares to be incompatible with newer devices.


